    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d237-a2">

                <pb facs="0533" n="409" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg409"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Appendix to letter of Messrs. Armour &amp;
                        Co.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bordeaux</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-05-18"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 18,
                        1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Armour</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Chicago:</hi></p>
                <p>Bordeaux-Havre deputies had, yesterday, interview with minister commerce, who
                    asserted that American papers are full of revelation on extent and intensity of
                    trichina in America. We advise strong protest from the press, and true reports
                    sent by officials.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
